         dde-shell
Description: AI coding plan quota applet for DDE Shell
 DDE Shell plugin for the taskbar that shows the remaining quota of
 AI coding plans (Codex, Claude, Kimi Code, GLM Coding, MiniMax),
 read directly from the vendors' official usage APIs using credentials
 of the local coding-agent CLIs or user-added API keys.
